Package: uniflow-ipp-server
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser, cups-daemon, cups-client, systemd
Recommends: cups-filters
Suggests: uniflow-login
Description: unofficial IPP server connecting CUPS to uniFLOW Online
 Accepts PDF print jobs from a local CUPS queue on a loopback address and
 can upload them to a uniFLOW Online Secure Print queue.
 .
 This is an independent project, not affiliated with NT-ware. The default
 configuration only holds PDFs locally until cloud access is configured.

Package: uniflow-login
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
         python3-pyside6.qtwebenginewidgets,
         python3-pyside6.qtwidgets,
         python3-cryptography
Suggests: uniflow-ipp-server
Description: Qt login app for the uniFLOW IPP server
 Performs tenant OAuth sign-in using a tenant .tenantcfg.plist and exports
 configuration for uniflow-ipp-server.

